Package: loxofed
Type: Package
Title: Federated Dynamic Bayesian Network and Mortality Analysis for LOXO
Version: 0.7.6
Authors@R: person("Julian", "Librero", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Site-side and central tools to reproduce the LOXO multimorbidity
    analysis (two-layer 2-TBN of disease progression plus a discrete-time
    cloglog mortality hazard) in a federated way. Sites run the analysis on
    the common data model (persons + diseases tables) and export only
    aggregated, small-cell-suppressed results; a central node builds a
    consensus network and meta-analyses the coefficients.
License: Unlimited
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: data.table, bnlearn, yaml, jsonlite, digest, splines, stats, utils, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), metafor, knitr, ggraph, tidygraph, patchwork, ggrepel, visNetwork, DT, htmltools, jsonlite
Encoding: UTF-8
